From fe948fa75016cf4510c70bdf835a1009c35b6c61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:19:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 2D LiDAR-inertial odometry (LIO) in new state_estimation
 package

- lio_core: IMU-propagated prior + point-to-line scan-to-submap matching (MAP),
  eigenvalue-based degeneracy handling, online gyro bias, sliding-window keyframes
  (no global map, no loop closure); numpy/scipy only
- lio_node: ROS 2 node, /scan + /imu -> /lio/odometry (per-step covariance, no TF)
- imu_core: IMU-only dead reckoning (baseline)
- synthetic_world/synthetic_eval + pytest: ray-cast arena and corridor with ground truth
- launch lio_node from zippy.launch.xml

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KtcRkfw1W3hqMkuqb5VFF2
